@* Blazor's reconnect dialog, in the systm's shape. Blazor replaces its own dialog with the element
   that carries id components-reconnect-modal: it toggles components-reconnect-show / -failed /
   -paused / -resume-failed / -rejected on it and fills the two attempt counters; everything else
   here is ours. Put it in App.razor after the routes, as a static component (it renders once; the
   classes Blazor toggles stay on the element). The messages for every state are in the markup and
   the state class picks one. One copy, for IndxServer, the licence portal and IndxObservr. *@
<div id="components-reconnect-modal" class="indx-reconnect" role="alertdialog" aria-live="assertive" aria-labelledby="indx-reconnect-title">
    <div class="indx-reconnect-panel">
        <p id="indx-reconnect-title" class="indx-reconnect-title">
            <span class="indx-reconnect-reconnecting"><Spinner Size="21" Class="indx-reconnect-icon" AriaLabel="Reconnecting" /> Reconnecting</span>
            <span class="indx-reconnect-failed indx-reconnect-resume-failed">Connection lost</span>
            <span class="indx-reconnect-paused"><Spinner Size="21" Class="indx-reconnect-icon" AriaLabel="Resuming" /> Resuming</span>
            <span class="indx-reconnect-rejected">Session ended</span>
        </p>
        <p class="indx-reconnect-body">
            <span class="indx-reconnect-reconnecting">Attempt <span id="components-reconnect-current-attempt"></span> of <span id="components-reconnect-max-retries"></span>. Your work is kept while we restore the connection.</span>
            <span class="indx-reconnect-failed">The server could not be reached. Retry keeps your unsaved work if the server is back; Reload starts fresh.</span>
            <span class="indx-reconnect-resume-failed">The paused session could not be restored. Resume again, or reload the page.</span>
            <span class="indx-reconnect-paused">Your session was paused while inactive and is being restored.</span>
            <span class="indx-reconnect-rejected">The server restarted or your session expired. Reload to continue.</span>
        </p>
        <div class="indx-reconnect-actions">
            <button type="button" class="indx-reconnect-btn indx-reconnect-btn--primary indx-reconnect-failed" onclick="window.Blazor.reconnect()">Retry now</button>
            <button type="button" class="indx-reconnect-btn indx-reconnect-btn--primary indx-reconnect-resume-failed" onclick="window.Blazor.resume()">Resume</button>
            <button type="button" class="indx-reconnect-btn indx-reconnect-btn--secondary indx-reconnect-failed indx-reconnect-resume-failed indx-reconnect-rejected" onclick="location.reload()">Reload</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
